    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n30338" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐγκοιμ-άομαι</span></b> , 
			Pass.
		 with fut.
		
			Med.
		, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>sleep in</i> a
			place, [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐν σπηλαίῳ</span>] <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Mir.</u>
				839a3
			</span></i>; esp. <i>sleep in</i> a temple, to seek prophetic dreams
			or to obtain cure for a disease, <i><span class="en">
				Str.
				11.7.1
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				16.2.35
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.109c
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπὲρ ἐνεργείας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arr.
					<u>Epict.</u>
					2.16.17
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>sleep upon</i> or <i>after</i> a meal, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Acut.</u>
				29
			</span></i>.</div>
